            "name": "Create Resolver Endpoint",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Creates a Resolver endpoint. There are two types of Resolver endpoints, inbound and outbound:</p> <ul> <li> <p>An <i>inbound Resolver endpoint</i> forwards DNS queries to the DNS service for a VPC from your network.</p> </li> <li> <p>An <i>outbound Resolver endpoint</i> forwards DNS queries from the DNS service for a VPC to your network.</p> </li> </ul>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
